lso extended towards cancer net  which is can we leverage our findings  and learnings in the models we build and  transfer this knowledge for  uh cancer diagnosis and prognosis  and as usual we're always looking for  collaborations from around the world so  feel free to contact me at any time and  happy to collaborate  and last but not least i'm going to do  special thanks to our now pretty large  covet net team uh consisting of  researchers and collaborators worldwide  also love to thank the hospitals that  have collaborated and work with us on  our different initiatives because  without clinical partner support none of  this would happen  and also want to thank the different  corporate partners for supporting our  project our initiative all this time  and so thank you very much for listening  and my emails down there if you're  interested in collaboration definitely  let me know we're always expanding this  project to make sure that we  provide as much as we can to the  community at large
 

